@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@userId = 2

### Sign in as the admin first (Account.http → Login Account)

### List UserAdmin
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/users

### ResetPassword UserAdmin (returns a temporary password)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/reset-password
X-LivingDex: 1

### Delete UserAdmin
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
X-LivingDex: 1
